            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "What is hybrid AI? Analyst explains what more companies are doing",
            "description": "<p>Advanced Micro Devices (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AMD\">AMD</a>) is hosting its analyst day at the Nasdaq on Tuesday, which could prove to be a pivotal moment as the AI chip race with competitor Nvidia (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVDA\">NVDA</a>) tightens.</p>\n<p>TECHnalysis Research, LLC president Bob O'Donnell sits down with Market Catalysts host <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/julie-hyman/?.tsrc=fin-srch\">Julie Hyman</a> to explain what hybrid AI (artificial intelligence) and why he is bullish on the dynamic of hyperscalers building out AI infrastructure and investing in physical AI data centers and GPUs.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-catalysts/\">Market Catalysts</a>.</p>",
